 "content": "<div class=\"gl-page\">\n<div class=\"gl-header\"><span class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Rechtliches</span></p>\n<h1>Impressum</h1>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gl-grid\">\n<div class=\"gl-card\">\n<h3>Angaben gemäß § 5 TMG</h3>\n<p>Anton Weiss</p>\n<p>c/o POSTFLEX #PFX-962-176<br />\nEmsdettener Straße 10<br />\n48268 Greven<br />\nDeutschland</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gl-card\">\n<h3>Kontakt</h3>\n<p>E-Mail: <a href=\"mailto:support@aminolabspro.com\">support@aminolabspro.com</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gl-card\">\n<h3>Umsatzsteuer</h3>\n<p>Gemäß § 19 Abs. 1 UStG wird keine Umsatzsteuer berechnet und ausgewiesen (Kleinunternehmerregelung).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gl-card\">\n<div class=\"gl-card gl-wide\">\n<h3>Alternative Streitbeilegung gemäß § 36 VSBG</h3>\n<p>Zur Teilnahme an einem Streitbeilegungsverfahren vor einer Verbraucherschlichtungsstelle sind wir nicht verpflichtet und nicht bereit.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style>\n.gl-page {<br />\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F0FBF7 0%, #FFFFFF 100%);<br />\n  padding: 60px 20px 70px;<br />\n}<br />\n.gl-header {<br />\n  text-align: center;<br />\n  margin-bottom: 44px;<br />\n}<br />\n.gl-eyebrow {<br />\n  display: inline-block;<br />\n  font-size: 11px;<br />\n  font-weight: 600;<br />\n  letter-spacing: 2px;<br />\n  text-transform: uppercase;<br />\n  color: #4DC49A;<br />\n  margin-bottom: 10px;<br />\n}<br />\n.gl-header h1 {<br />\n  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);<br />\n  font-weight: 700;<br />\n  color: #1A1F2E;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>.gl-grid {<br />\n  max-width: 980px;<br />\n  margin: 0 auto;<br />\n  display: grid;<br />\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);<br />\n  gap: 18px;<br />\n}<br />\n.gl-wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }</p>\n<p>.gl-card {<br />\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);<br />\n  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);<br />\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);<br />\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.8);<br />\n  border-radius: 18px;<br />\n  padding: 26px 28px;<br />\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(110,218,180,0.12);<br />\n}</p>\n<p>.gl-icon {<br />\n  color: #4DC49A;<br />\n  margin-bottom: 14px;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>.gl-card h3 {<br />\n  font-size: 14px;<br />\n  font-weight: 600;<br />\n  color: #1A1F2E;<br />\n  margin-bottom: 10px;<br />\n  letter-spacing: 0.2px;<br />\n}<br />\n.gl-card p {<br />\n  font-size: 13.5px;<br />\n  color: #5A6478;<br />\n  line-height: 1.75;<br />\n}<br />\n.gl-card a {<br />\n  color: #4DC49A;<br />\n  text-decoration: underline;<br />\n}<br />\n.gl-card a:hover { color: #6EDAB4; }</p>\n<p>@media (max-width: 700px) {<br />\n  .gl-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }<br />\n}<br />\n</style>\n</div>\n",
